From 41f1c5c1bf60c7519ed7bd28e739e0254257dcae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Eden (Doris) build" <doris@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:08:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Eden (Doris): versionCode can come from DORIS_VERSION_CODE

APKs of one release (the current build and the one without the newer Eden fixes) get the same
versionCode, so either installs over the other and the app keeps its data.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014Ps8wnhVXtSU7d88gGtyHX
(cherry picked from commit ff0a2617a08e153c2fb17c81fd4784f5e177d7f4)
---
 src/android/app/build.gradle.kts | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/android/app/build.gradle.kts b/src/android/app/build.gradle.kts
index 75ec07279..87fd4c5f3 100644
--- a/src/android/app/build.gradle.kts
+++ b/src/android/app/build.gradle.kts
@@ -27,7 +27,10 @@ plugins {
  * This lets us upload a new build at most every 10 seconds for the
  * next 680 years.
  */
-val autoVersion = (((System.currentTimeMillis() / 1000) - 1451606400) / 10).toInt()
+// Eden (Doris): the build can set it (DORIS_VERSION_CODE), so APKs from the same release share one
+// versionCode and install over each other either way, keeping the app's data.
+val autoVersion = System.getenv("DORIS_VERSION_CODE")?.toIntOrNull()
+    ?: (((System.currentTimeMillis() / 1000) - 1451606400) / 10).toInt()
 
 val edenDir = project(":Eden").projectDir
 
